                       login first ✓

  Your own web address, like movies.example.com, will open your Apps from
  anywhere through Cloudflare Tunnel, without opening any port on your router.
  A login page will stand in front, so only people you allow get in.

  Not available yet
  This option is coming soon. For now your Apps stay where they are, and
  choosing it changes nothing.

  Who can get in?
  Anyone with the address reaches the login page, and only people you allow

